 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Not at all. Many adults become fluent in their forties or fiftys. The harder part is often finding someone to talk to. That's the challenge, and it the one you' facing. Learn phrases with voice recognition software, and say lot of short sentences. Those are wonderful choices. Living in a country where the language is spoken also changes your lifestyle, which speeds learning. Download the Duolingo app and plow through the beginner modules. Then find a language exchange partner in your city.",
